{"id":"d11732572066c4e5","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-tm-output-unique.md","title":"确定性与有限支撑保证输出唯一","display":"lem-tm-output-unique — 确定性与有限支撑保证输出唯一","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-tm-output-unique","aliases":["20-lem-tm-output-unique"],"display":"lem-tm-output-unique — 确定性与有限支撑保证输出唯一","chapter":"1","section":"1.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definitions 1.4.1–1.4.2；配置关系的直接论证","source_printed_pages":[7,8,9],"source_pdf_pages":[43,44,45],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tmcomp]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-tm-output-unique"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-tm-output-unique</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-tm-output-unique — 确定性与有限支撑保证输出唯一"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 1.4.1–1.4.2；配置关系的直接论证"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>7</span><span>8</span><span>9</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span><span>44</span><span>45</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(M\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\omega\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tm\\text{-}output\\text{-}unique}\\vdash\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\land M(x)\\downarrow=z\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ y=z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tm\\text{-}output\\text{-}unique}\\vdash\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\land M(x)\\downarrow=z\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ y=z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个配置至多有一个后继；对计算长度归纳，两条从同一输入出发的历史在共同长度内一致。停止状态没有后继，所以它们的末配置相同。初始磁带有限支撑，单步只改变一个格，归纳每一步仍有限支撑；因此末磁带上 1 的数量是唯一自然数。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 1.4.1–1.4.2；配置关系的直接论证；印刷页 7, 8, 9；PDF 第 43, 44, 45 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tm\\text{-}output\\text{-}unique}\\vdash\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\land M(x)\\downarrow=z\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ y=z.","display":true}],"bytes":1314,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-tm-output-unique]] — 章 1；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-lem-tm-output-unique]]"}],"outgoing":["04aa1148d91b88f8"]}